hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1042.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"1042.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"1043.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abdullah ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabia al-Makhzumi ordered one of his slaves to slaughter an animal. When he wanted to slaughter it"
"1043.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abdullah ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabia al-Makhzumi ordered one of his slaves to slaughter an animal. When he wanted to slaughter it"
"1044.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man from the Ansar of the tribe of Banu Haritha was herding a pregnant she-camel at Uhud. It was about to die"
"1044.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man from the Ansar of the tribe of Banu Haritha was herding a pregnant she-camel at Uhud. It was about to die"
"1045.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from a man of the Ansar from Muadh ibn Sad or Sad ibn Muadh that a slave-girl of Kab ibn Malik was herding some sheep at Sal (a mountain near Madina). One of the sheep was about to die"
"1045.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from a man of the Ansar from Muadh ibn Sad or Sad ibn Muadh that a slave-girl of Kab ibn Malik was herding some sheep at Sal (a mountain near Madina). One of the sheep was about to die"
"1046.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked about animals slaughtered by the Christian Arabs. He said"
"1046.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked about animals slaughtered by the Christian Arabs. He said"
"1047.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abbas used to say"
"1047.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abbas used to say"
"1048.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1048.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1049.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abu Murra"
"1049.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abu Murra"
"1050.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1050.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1051.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt al-Laythi that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"1051.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt al-Laythi that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
